## Campaign Flow (Draft → Bracket)
1. User configures formation, play style, draft mode on `/draft`
2. Nation dice draft: roll team → pick player for open formation slot (11 rounds)
3. `loadBracketTree(getPredictions(), liveMatches)` resolves R32–Final opponents
4. User simulates knockout matches; win advances, loss ends campaign
5. State persisted in `localStorage` key `wc26-campaign-state`
